<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<aside class="auth-story" aria-label="医疗云介绍">
  <div class="selected-cloud"><svg class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/assets/icons.svg#cloud"/></svg><div><strong>医疗云服务</strong><small>当前服务环境</small></div><span>已选择</span></div>
  <div class="auth-story-content">
    <h2>一个门户，连接诊疗服务</h2>
    <p class="auth-intro">根据账号身份进入对应工作台，办理预约、接诊和医院管理业务。</p>
    <div class="service-audiences">
      <div><svg class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/assets/icons.svg#calendar"/></svg><strong>患者服务</strong><span>查询号源、预约挂号、病历与账单</span></div>
      <div><svg class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/assets/icons.svg#consultation"/></svg><strong>医生接诊</strong><span>处理本院预约、接诊草稿与病历</span></div>
      <div><svg class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/assets/icons.svg#building"/></svg><strong>医院管理</strong><span>维护科室、医生、排班与号源</span></div>
      <div><svg class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/assets/icons.svg#chart"/></svg><strong>平台运营</strong><span>医院入驻、脱敏统计与操作审计</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="care-flow"><div><span>01</span><strong>预约挂号</strong><small>查询号源与管理预约</small></div><div><span>02</span><strong>在线接诊</strong><small>记录病历与医生建议</small></div><div><span>03</span><strong>诊疗账单</strong><small>查看账单与模拟缴费</small></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="auth-footnote">登录后，系统根据账号身份提供相应服务。</div>
</aside>
